{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/firewall' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/firewall' data-title='Firewall'>\r\n\t\t\tFirewall\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Audit failed object access on Windows 7 and 8 and read WFP block events 5152 and 5157.","label":"Blocked connections","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn Windows 7 and 8, enable auditing of failed connections.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Local Computer Policy &gt; Computer Configuration &gt; Windows Settings &gt; Security Settings &gt; Local Policies &gt; Audit Policy &gt; Audit object access : Failure<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDropped connections, with the corresponding executable name, show at:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Event log &gt; Windows Logs &gt; Security<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>The Windows Filtering Platform has blocked a packet \u2014 Event Id <code class='inline'>5152<\/code>.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>The Windows Filtering Platform has blocked a connection \u2014 Event Id <code class='inline'>5157<\/code>.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApplication Name example:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\\device\\harddiskvolume2\\program files\\xyz.exe<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/firewall\/log_blocked_outgoing_connections\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/firewall\/log_blocked_outgoing_connections\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/firewall' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/firewall' data-title='Firewall'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Firewall<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}